guide forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale
title Stranglethorn Vale & Swamp of Sorrows
faction Horde
levels 40-43
zone Stranglethorn Vale
next forever/horde/40-50/02-feralas
# Route from the Polestar route simulator's Horde consensus (Tauren export),
# visit 31 (Stranglethorn Vale, levels 40.2-42.3) and visit 32 (Swamp of
# Sorrows, 42.3-42.5) of the export it was written from; the October
# refresh's export has them as visits 30 (Stranglethorn 40.9-42.9) and 28
# (Swamp of Sorrows 36-40 quests, at 40.0-40.4, before Desolace). Checked by
# lint, not play-tested on Forever yet. Era + known Forever quests only.
#
# Flow: Shadowprey Village -> fly Ratchet -> boat to Booty Bay -> the
# Bloodsail cove, the Wild Shore and the Bloodsail ships -> Booty Bay ->
# Mistvale Valley (gorillas, Mokk) -> Zanzil's camps -> the Venture Co. mine
# -> Grom'gol (bind) -> Nesingwary -> Zul'Kunda -> hearth to Grom'gol ->
# jungle stalkers -> the naga shore and the Holy Spring -> Booty Bay (bind)
# -> the ghost pirates -> Zul'Mamwe and the Balia'mah and Ziata'jai trophy
# skulls -> Grom'gol -> hearth to Booty Bay -> fly Grom'gol -> Nesingwary ->
# north through Duskwood and Deadwind Pass -> the Harborage -> Stonard
# (flight path) -> Galen's escort, the Draenethyst crystals, Noboru and
# Galen's strongbox -> crocolisks -> the Harborage -> Misty Reed Post -> the
# snappers on the strand -> Misty Reed Post.
#
# Deviations from the simulator's order:
# - One stay at Zul'Mamwe for Speaking with Gan'zulah (586), Split Bone
#   Necklace (598), Skullsplitter Tusks (209) and Speaking with Nezzliok
#   (585), instead of a separate Zul'Mamwe visit on the way north: every
#   Skullsplitter drops the tusks, and the necklaces alone need a long stay
#   there.
# - Speaking with Nezzliok (585) is taken at the Bubbling Cauldron with
#   Speaking with Gan'zulah (586), not at level 44 (export visit 38): its
#   three trophy piles stand at Zul'Mamwe, Ziata'jai and Balia'mah, all on
#   the same Zul'Mamwe loop, so merging saves a later trip from Grom'gol.
# - Witch Doctor Unbagwa's part of Stranglethorn Fever (349) is taken before
#   the gorillas, so the fangs and the giblets come from the same kills.
# - Binds: the simulator's Booty Bay bind on arrival is dropped (replaced by
#   Grom'gol before any hearth). Grom'gol (for the hearth back from
#   Zul'Kunda) and Booty Bay are kept.
# - Hearthstone: the simulator rebinds at Grom'gol, hearths there from
#   Nesingwary and flies to Booty Bay for Voodoo Dues. Here the Booty Bay
#   bind carries you from Grom'gol to Booty Bay, and one flight back to
#   Grom'gol puts Nesingwary on the road north. The Stonard bind is dropped:
#   the route never hearths to it before the next bind.
# - Swamp of Sorrows: the Harborage (Noboru the Cudgel) after the
#   crocolisks, so the west of the swamp is visited once before riding to
#   Misty Reed Post.
# - Added in the October refresh, from the new export (Forever above 30
#   cannot be checked in game until launch on 4 November: from the data, not
#   from play): Draenethyst Crystals (1389). Magtoor gives it at the
#   Harborage, so the route stops there first on the way in; the crystals
#   stand in the Fallow Sanctuary on the way up to Galen's cage.
#
# Turned in here from earlier guides: Sunken Treasure (669, from Shakes
# O'Breen in forever/horde/30-40/03-arathi-highlands) at Fleet Master Seahorn
# on the first Booty Bay stop; the export hands it in at level 44, on a
# separate Booty Bay trip that the route drops. Report to Helgrum (1420, from
# the Badlands). The Troll Witchdoctor (1240, from forever/horde/30-40/04-
# dustwallow-marsh) at Kin'weelay in Grom'gol.
#
# Optional: The Bloodsail Buccaneers (608): the three captains are 45-48 on
# decks crewed by 42-45 pirates, at about 41.
#
# Accepted here, finished later on the route: Stoley's Debt (2872) and
# Tran'rek (2864) in Tanaris; Cortello's Riddle (624) in the Swamp of
# Sorrows; Grim Message (2932) in the Hinterlands, around level 48.
#
# Left out: Sunken Treasure part 6 (670: Seahorn sends you back to Shakes
# O'Breen in Arathi, and the route never returns there); Goblin Sponsorship
# (1182: its chain 1178-1181 starts at Pozzik in Thousand Needles and runs
# through Gazlowe in Ratchet, none of it on the route, and Cozzle's
# footlocker sits in the Venture Co. camp at Lake Nazferiti, off this loop).
# Left out from the refreshed export:
# - Ancient Gurubashi Idol (96774, new in Forever, 8,800 XP): a dungeon quest
#   in the Drowned City ("gather some friends", wowforevertalents.com, read
#   from the beta client). The data places its giver Mazu'kon in north-west
#   Mulgore (32.5,20.6), which the export visits for it alone at 43.3; no
#   other source places him, so it is not added.
# - Lost in Transit (93663, new, Dar in Stonard to Magtoor): the data has no
#   place for the missing courier or the Courier's Shipment.
# - My Little Friends (93176, new, Amaryllis Webb west of Stonard): its
#   critters are an Arbor Tarantula in Stranglethorn, a Hay Weevil in Arathi
#   and a Flesh Picker in Desolace (data), caught with a kit you only get
#   here; the route has left all three zones by now.
# - Neeka Bloodscar (1418): the export takes it in the Swamp before the
#   Badlands; here the Badlands come first and Report to Helgrum (1420)
#   arrives from Neeka instead.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The way in

step Fly to Ratchet
  zone Desolace
  tip From Shadowprey Village fly to Ratchet.
  fly "Ratchet"

step Boat to Booty Bay
  zone The Barrens
  tip The boat to Booty Bay docks at the end of Ratchet's pier.
  goto 63.4,38.5 "Ratchet pier"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Booty Bay

step Booty Bay
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip The boat lands in Booty Bay's harbour. The quest givers stand on the boardwalks around the harbour and in the inn.
  accept 348                            -- Fin Fizracket
  accept 595                            -- First Mate Crazz
  accept 606                            -- "Sea Wolf" MacKinley
  accept 2872                           -- for Stoley in Tanaris
  accept 600                            -- Crank Fizzlebub
  accept 621
  accept 209                            -- Kebok
  accept 2864                           -- Krazek: for Tran'rek in Gadgetzan
  accept 617                            -- Privateer Bloads
  vendor nearest

# Group quests (sim elites): The Captain's Chest, about 6 min saved for a party
step The Captain's Chest
  when group 8551
  accept 8551

step The Captain's Chest
  when group 8551
  tip Gorlash is elite: grouping up is advised.
  collect 3932 quest 8551.1

step The Captain's Chest
  when group 8551
  turnin 8551

step Bloodsail Correspondence
  tip Leave town by the tunnel; the note lies in the pirates' cove just north of Booty Bay.
  turnin 595
  accept 597

step Booty Bay
  turnin 597                            -- First Mate Crazz
  accept 599
  turnin 599                            -- Fleet Master Seahorn
  turnin 669
  accept 604
  accept 587                            -- Deeg
  accept 576                            -- Dizzy One-Eye

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Bloodsail Buccaneers

step The Wild Shore
  tip South of Booty Bay the Bloodsail swashbucklers camp on the Wild Shore; the charts and the orders lie in their tents. Any Bloodsail can carry snuff and Dizzy's eye, so keep killing until you have both.
  kill 1563 quest 604.1
  collect 3920 quest 604.2
  collect 3921 quest 604.3
  collect 3910 quest 587.1
  collect 3897 quest 576.1

step Booty Bay
  turnin 604                            -- Fleet Master Seahorn
  accept 608
  turnin 587                            -- Deeg
  turnin 576                            -- Dizzy One-Eye

step The Bloodsail ships
  tip The three ships lie off the Wild Shore. The crews are 42-45, Stillwater 45, Keelhaul 46 and Fleet Master Firallon 48: at 41 this is a fight for a group, or for the end of the guide. If you go, swim out and pull the crew to the rail one at a time. A scroll, Cortello's Riddle, lies on the ships' decks: take it.
  kill 2550 quest 608.1 optional
  kill 2548 quest 608.2 optional
  kill 2546 quest 608.3 optional
  collect 4056 "Cortello's Riddle"
  accept 624                            -- for a later stop in the Swamp of Sorrows

step Booty Bay
  turnin 608 optional                   -- Fleet Master Seahorn

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- North through the jungle

step Witch Doctor Unbagwa
  tip Take the road north out of Booty Bay; Unbagwa sits on a hill in Mistvale Valley, east of the road.
  accept 349

step Mistvale gorillas
  tip The gorillas roam the valley around Unbagwa. The elders drop the giblets; any of them can drop a fang.
  collect 3919 quest 606.1
  collect 2799 quest 349.1

step Mokk the Savage
  tip Hand Unbagwa the fangs and stay by him: he calls three waves of gorillas, then Mokk. Fight them one at a time.
  turnin 349
  collect 2797 quest 348.1

step Zanzil's camps
  tip North-east of Mistvale, Zanzil's followers camp in the jungle; every one of them can carry the mixture.
  collect 4016 quest 621.1

step Venture Co. mine
  tip Further north, the goblins of the Venture Co. dig at the mine east of the road; miners, foremen, surveyors and tinkerers all drop the crystals.
  collect 3917 quest 600.1

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Grom'gol and the north

step Grom'gol Base Camp
  tip Ride north-west to Grom'gol.
  sethome "Grom'gol Base Camp" npc 5814 -- Innkeeper Thulbek
  accept 573                            -- Far Seer Mok'thardin
  accept 584                            -- Nimboya
  accept 2932                           -- for later: the Hinterlands, around level 48
  accept 598                            -- Kin'weelay
  turnin 1240                           -- Kin'weelay

step Nesingwary's Expedition
  tip Ride north up the road; the hunters camp on the hill above the river.
  accept 196                            -- Hemet Nesingwary

step Zul'Kunda
  tip West of the expedition, the Bloodscalp chiefs Gan'zulah and Nezzliok stand together in the ruins of Zul'Kunda. Clear their guards first, then pull them.
  collect 3904 quest 584.1
  collect 3905 quest 584.2

step Hearth to Grom'gol
  hearth "Grom'gol Base Camp"
  turnin 584                            -- the Bubbling Cauldron, beside Nimboya
  accept 586
  accept 585

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- South to Booty Bay

step Jungle stalkers
  tip The stalker raptors hunt the jungle south of Grom'gol, out towards the west coast.
  kill 687 quest 196.1

step Naga shore and the Holy Spring
  tip Follow the coast south. The naga explorers wade along the shore and carry the reed bundles; the Holy Spring bubbles in the hills just east of them.
  kill 1907 quest 573.1
  collect 4029 quest 617.1
  collect 737 quest 573.2 @29.0,61.9

step Booty Bay
  tip Ride south to Booty Bay. Shaky Phillipe waits on the docks.
  sethome "Booty Bay" npc 6807          -- Innkeeper Skindle
  turnin 617                            -- Privateer Bloads
  turnin 606                            -- "Shaky" Phillipe
  accept 607
  turnin 607                            -- "Sea Wolf" MacKinley
  accept 609
  turnin 621                            -- Crank Fizzlebub
  turnin 600
  turnin 348                            -- Fin Fizracket
  vendor nearest

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Voodoo Dues and Zul'Mamwe

step Pirate ghosts
  tip The three ghostly pirates haunt the jungle north of Booty Bay, near Zanzil's camps: Maury and Jon-Jon stand together, Chucky further east.
  kill 2535 @35.3,51.3
  collect 3924 quest 609.1
  kill 2536 @34.9,51.8
  collect 3925 quest 609.2
  kill 2537 @40.0,58.2
  collect 3926 quest 609.3

step Zul'Mamwe
  tip Ride north to the Skullsplitter ruins east of the Venture Co. mine; pull the headhunters and berserkers one at a time. Ana'thek the Cruel guards the south-western ruins, and one pile of trophy skulls stands on the ruins' north side. Every Skullsplitter can drop a tusk or a necklace: the necklaces are the slow part, so keep killing in the warriors' camp north of the ruins until you have them all.
  kill 669 quest 586.1
  kill 781 quest 586.2
  kill 783 quest 586.3
  collect 3909 quest 586.4 @44.3,45.0
  collect 3908 quest 585.3
  goto 45.4,36.2 "Skullsplitter warriors"
  collect 1524 quest 209.1
  collect 3916 quest 598.1

step Balia'mah Ruins
  tip The next trophy skulls stand in the small ruins just north of the warriors' camp.
  collect 3906 quest 585.1

step Ziata'jai Ruins
  tip The last skulls are in the ruins a short ride west, on the way back to Grom'gol.
  collect 3907 quest 585.2

step Grom'gol Base Camp
  tip Ride west to Grom'gol.
  turnin 573                            -- Far Seer Mok'thardin
  turnin 586                            -- the Bubbling Cauldron
  turnin 585
  turnin 598                            -- Kin'weelay

step Hearth to Booty Bay
  hearth "Booty Bay"
  turnin 609                            -- "Sea Wolf" MacKinley
  turnin 209                            -- Kebok

