# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Swamp of Sorrows

step Into the Swamp of Sorrows
  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  tip Keep riding north into Duskwood, then east along the road through Deadwind Pass into the swamp. Magtoor waits at the Harborage, the draenei camp near the way in from Deadwind Pass.
  accept 1389                           -- Magtoor

step Stonard
  tip Ride east to Stonard, in the reeds south of the road.
  getfp "Stonard" npc 6026              -- Breyk
  turnin 1420                           -- Helgrum the Swift
  accept 698                            -- Dar

step Draenethyst crystals
  tip Ride north-east to the Fallow Sanctuary. The crystals stand along the way up to Galen Goodward's cage.
  collect 6071 x6 quest 1389.1          -- Draenethyst Crystals

step Galen's Escape
  tip Galen Goodward is held in the Fallow Sanctuary in the swamp's north-east. Free him and follow him out, fighting off the swamp creatures that chase him.
  accept 1393
  complete 1393

step Noboru the Cudgel
  tip Noboru wanders the clearing south-west of the Fallow Sanctuary; his cudgel starts a quest.
  kill 5477 @54.9,34.1
  collect 6196 "Noboru's Cudgel"
  accept 1392

step Galen's Strongbox
  tip His strongbox waits at his old camp north of Stonard.
  turnin 1393

step Sawtooth crocolisks
  tip The crocolisks wallow in the pools around Galen's camp and south towards Stonard; about one in four drops a flank.
  collect 6169 quest 698.1

step The Harborage
  tip Ride west along the road to the draenei camp at the Harborage, near the way in from Deadwind Pass.
  turnin 1392                           -- Magtoor
  turnin 1389

step Misty Reed Post
  tip Ride back east past Stonard and follow the road south-east to the small Horde post on the shore.
  turnin 698                            -- Tok'Kar
  accept 699

step Sawtooth snappers
  tip The snappers line the strand south of the post.
  collect 6168 quest 699.1

step Misty Reed Post
  tip The next guide starts here and takes you to Tanaris.
  turnin 699                            -- Tok'Kar
